Package: supralinux-icons
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: librsvg2-common
Description: SupraLINUX Aurora icon themes
 Complete icon themes for SupraLINUX Aurora, based on Breeze and Breeze
 Dark. Both themes are self-contained: every icon directory is declared
 and no link points outside the theme. Cursors and widget styles remain
 provided by Breeze.
